data: {"id": "32451479e6a8479c-final", "run_id": "32451479e6a8479c", "seq": 1247, "ts_ms": 1788777288547, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 Pending 状态，容器 app 处于 Waiting 状态，Reason=CreateContainerConfigError |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning Failed 59m (x12 over 61m) kubelet Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 确认为容器配置错误，直接归因于缺失 Secret Key |\n| 2 | K8s State | container.waiting_message | `container: app, message: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 与 Event 一致，证明容器启动失败的具体技术原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | pod.phase | `Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于挂起状态，未进入运行态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | pod.condition | `Ready=False (ContainersNotReady), Initialized=True` | 确认 Pod 初始化成功但因容器未就绪而不可用 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 量化确认容器等待原因为配置错误，与 K8s 事实交叉印证 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n- **编号 1 & 2**：Kubernetes 事件与容器等待消息完全一致，直接锁定了 `unavailable-key` 缺失是失败原因。\n- **编号 1 & 5**：Metric 中的 `reason` 标签与 Event 中的错误类型（`CreateContainerConfigError`）完全匹配，排除了其他类型启动异常的可能性。\n- **编号 3 & 4**：状态条件证实了 Pod 已调度并成功初始化，但由于容器配置问题导致 `ContainersNotReady`，符合配置错误的典型表现。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod Spec 引用 Secret key 'unavailable-key' → Secret 'workload-input' 中缺失该 Key → kubelet 注入环境变量失败 → Pod 进入 CreateContainerConfigError 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因：Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 的容器配置引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`（证据 #1, #2, #5）。由于该 Key 缺失，kubelet 在创建容器时无法完成环境变量注入，导致容器处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态并持续重启等待，最终表现为 Pod 处于 `Pending` 且不可用（证据 #3, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p: 41.1s (Evidence 31.7s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.457, "metrics": {"run_id": "32451479e6a8479c", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.46342182159424, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 68463.42182159424, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 64668.696880340576, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8806.280612945557, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3526.871681213379}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18705.02734184265, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41089.17832374573, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8648.598432540894, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

